---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import LegalHeader from "../components/LegalHeader.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Belpa"
  description="Terms for roofers using Belpa on their website."
>
  <main class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <article class="legal-panel rounded-3xl p-7 sm:p-10">
      <LegalHeader otherHref="/privacy" otherLabel="Privacy Policy" />

      <h1 class="legal-title font-display">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: August 2026</p>

      <h2>What Belpa is</h2>
      <p>
        Belpa is a tool for roofing businesses. You add it to your website, or
        share it as a link and QR code, so customers can type an address and
        see an estimated price for roofing work. Belpa uses satellite imagery
        to measure the roof and return a price range for that property.
      </p>

      <h2>Who these terms cover</h2>
      <p>
        These terms apply to roofers and contractors who use Belpa, however
        they share it, and to anyone who uses a Belpa estimate. If you embed
        Belpa or hand out a Belpa link, you are responsible for how it appears
        and for the way you follow up with customers who use it.
      </p>

      <h2>Estimates are not final quotes</h2>
      <p>
        Every price Belpa shows is a ballpark figure to help a customer plan
        and to help you qualify leads. It is not a contract, an offer, or a
        final price. You or your team confirm the exact price after you
        inspect the property. Only that confirmed price counts.
      </p>

      <h2>Using Belpa</h2>
      <p>
        Belpa is free to try. You agree not to misuse the service, attempt to
        break it, scrape it at scale, or use it in a way that harms other
        users. You agree to only promote Belpa estimates for jobs you are
        willing and able to follow up on in good faith.
      </p>

      <h2>Accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        We work to make estimates useful, but satellite measurements and
        regional pricing have limits. We cannot guarantee accuracy. We are not
        responsible for business or hiring decisions made on an estimate alone.
      </p>

      <h2>Your content and branding</h2>
      <p>
        When you use Belpa, you may show it alongside your own branding.
        You keep ownership of your site and brand. You give us permission to
        run the estimate service on the pages and links where you place it.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms:
        <a href="mailto:hello@belpa.co.uk">hello@belpa.co.uk</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-panel {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(1.25);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(1.25);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-float);
  }

  /* Page hero — one clear focal point after the chrome. */
  .legal-title {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4.8vw, 2.45rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-meta {
    margin: 0.55rem 0 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-top: 2.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* First section sits closer to the title block. */
  .legal-meta + h2 {
    margin-top: 1.85rem;
  }

  p {
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  a {
    color: var(--color-brand-600);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
